# Nsight Systems profiling traces are large binary artifacts kept on GAAS only.
# Analysis is performed over SSH (nsys stats / Nsight GUI) rather than by
# committing the traces to the repository.
# Native report formats of Nsight Systems 2025.x (`*.nsys-rep`) and older
# releases (`*.qdrep`), plus intermediates.
*.qdrep
*.qdrep-*
*.nsys-rep
*.qdstrm
*.sqlite

# nccl-tests source tree and in-tree build artifacts for the internode-coms
# debug (cloned/built on GAAS only, inside build-nccl-tests/; provenance is
# recorded in that directory's README and attempt log).
scripts/gaas-internode-coms-debug/build-nccl-tests/nccl-tests/